n_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":104,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongliu-q-e76d9988594e126a9d3e","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-c007b99c30e3df8ac9f4","layer":"original","quote":"谡下狱，物故〖3〗，亮为之流涕","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":104,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":83,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongliu-q-e9d60a047f9d066765a0","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-c007b99c30e3df8ac9f4","layer":"original","quote":"亮进无所据，退军还汉中","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":104,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":71,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-5904600ce6ee553f0758","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"大败于街亭，众尽星散","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":35,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-8f70414a41aba2d4ce93","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"平连规谏谡，谡不能用","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-c17dcd424ae69fe98562","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"丞相亮既诛马谡及将军张休、李盛，夺将军黄袭等兵","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":93,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-cb50c70060b9dbdd4ff9","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"谡舍水上山，举措烦扰","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":13,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-d93fb00a0e39c932cd7f","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"于是平徐徐收合诸营遗迸〖1〗，率将士而还","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":72,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-ec683034033dae302667","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"惟平所领千人，鸣鼓自持。魏将张郃疑其伏兵，不往逼也","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":46,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0133","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-85aae37594d28a751d2e","layer":"original","quote":"会马谡败于街亭","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":128,"end":135,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0225","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-1fcbe6e22b07445711e4","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏略》曰：“天水太守马遵，将维及诸官属，随雍州刺史郭淮偶自西至洛门案行。会闻亮已到祁山，淮顾遵曰：‘是欲不善！’遂驱东，还上邽。遵念所治冀县界在西偏，又恐吏民乐乱，遂亦随淮去。时维谓遵曰：‘明府当还冀。’遵谓维等曰：‘卿诸人（回）〔叵〕复信，皆贼也！’各自行，维亦无如遵何；而家在冀，遂与郡吏上官子修等，还冀。冀中吏民见维等大喜，便推令见亮。二人不获已，乃共诣亮；亮见，大悦。未及遣迎冀中人，会亮前锋为张郃、费繇等所破，遂将维等却缩。维不得还，遂入蜀。诸军攻冀，皆得维母妻子；亦以维本无去意，故不没其家，但系保官以延之。”此语与本传不同。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-46e2cf216fe32246f7b2","start":0,"end":273,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0228","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-1fcbe6e22b07445711e4","layer":"pei","quote":"未及遣迎冀中人，会亮前锋为张郃、费繇等所破","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-46e2cf216fe32246f7b2","start":192,"end":213,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o009b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-aec45ce1d329ad6dfa62","layer":"original","quote":"蜀大将诸葛亮寇边〖4〗，天水、南安、安定三郡吏民叛应亮〖5〗。﹝二﹞遣大将军曹真都督关右〖6〗，并进兵。右将军张郃击亮于街亭〖7〗，大破之。亮败走，三郡平。丁未〖8〗，行幸长安。﹝三﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o052b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-6b09c300271ca978ec28","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮围祁山，南安、天水、安定三郡反应亮。帝遣真督诸军，军郿；遣张郃击亮将马谡〖12〗，大破之。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":19,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o035a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-1c7bb0c2a4ad2f049b9c","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮出祁山。加郃位特进，遣督诸军，拒亮将马谡于街亭。谡依阻南山，不下据城。郃绝其汲道〖2〗，击，大破之。南安、天水、安定郡反，应亮，郃皆破平之。诏曰：“贼亮以巴蜀之众，当虓虎之师〖3〗；将军被坚执锐，所向克定。朕甚嘉之！”益邑千户，并前四千三百户。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o033a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-7d68192c0e968e4ac882","layer":"original","quote":"魏明帝西镇长安，命张郃拒亮。亮使马谡督诸军在前，与郃战于街亭〖7〗。谡违亮节度，举动失宜，大为郃所破。亮拔西县千余家〖8〗，还于汉中，﹝三﹞戮谡以谢众〖9〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o034-judgment","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-ac0a1291d9674d568ae3","layer":"original","quote":"上疏曰：“臣以弱才，叨窃非据〖10〗，亲秉旄钺以厉三军〖11〗；不能训章明法，临事而惧〖12〗；至有街亭违命之阙，箕谷不戒之失〖13〗。咎皆在臣，授任无方；臣明不知人〖14〗，恤事多暗〖15〗。《春秋》责帅〖16〗，臣职是当〖17〗；请自贬三等，以督厥咎〖18〗。”","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":133,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
